<h2>About these files</h2>
<p>These are <strong>high-fidelity design references built in HTML/React (in-browser Babel)</strong> — not production code to ship as-is. Recreate them inside the existing codebase (Next.js / React / Vue…) using its own routing, data fetching, state and i18n. Final colors, type, spacing, copy and interactions — reproduce pixel-perfectly.</p>
<p>Preview: run <code>npx serve .</code> in this folder and open <code>/</code> (links to both). Keep the folder structure — pages load <code>../../styles.css</code>, <code>../../_ds_bundle.js</code>, <code>../../assets/</code>.</p>
<h2>Implementation order</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Tokens</strong> — <code>tokens/*.css</code> (CSS variables on <code>:root</code> + <code>[data-theme=&quot;light&quot;]</code>). Port as-is or into Tailwind/theme.</li>
<li><strong>Fonts</strong> — Geist + Geist Mono (<code>tokens/fonts.css</code> uses Google Fonts; or <code>geist</code> package / next/font).</li>
<li><strong>Icons</strong> — Lucide (<code>lucide-react</code>), stroke 1.5 (2 under 16px).</li>
<li><strong>Primitives</strong> — <code>components/**</code>: self-contained React (<code>.jsx</code>), props in <code>.d.ts</code>, usage in <code>.prompt.md</code>. Only CSS variables, no deps.</li>
<li><strong>Guardian</strong> — <code>ui_kits/website/guardian.js</code>: framework-agnostic web component <code>&lt;nodus-guardian&gt;</code> (three.js r184 from CDN; swap for <code>npm i three</code>).</li>
<li><strong>Screens</strong> — <code>ui_kits/website/*.jsx</code>, <code>ui_kits/console/*.jsx</code>.
<code>_ds_bundle.js</code> is the compiled primitives used by the prototypes — don&#39;t port it, port <code>components/</code>.</li>
</ol>
