<h3>Scroll-driven Guardian</h3>
<p>One <code>&lt;nodus-guardian stops=&quot;.guardian-stop&quot; intro&gt;</code> mounted once at app root as a fixed full-viewport layer <strong>behind</strong> content (<code>position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:1; pointer-events:none</code>); content above via <code>section &gt; * { position:relative; z-index:2 }</code>. Every <code>.guardian-stop</code> is a rebuild point.</p>
<ul>
<li>Scroll between stop n and n+1 → <code>sp</code> 0→1; position/scale interpolate between the two rects (ease-in-out cubic).</li>
<li>Dispersal <code>smoothstep(0,.45,sp)·(1−smoothstep(.55,1,sp))</code>, low-pass <code>1−exp(−dt·2.2)</code>; voxels spread over the whole viewport; layer fades to ~28% while dispersed.</li>
<li>First stop 3/4 pose, then front-facing. Head/eye mouse tracking only when assembled.</li>
<li>Element API: <code>disintegrate()</code>, <code>reassemble()</code>, <code>setProgress(0..1)</code>; attrs <code>no-pulse</code>, <code>intro</code>, <code>no-track</code>, <code>stops</code>.</li>
</ul>
