<h2>Global behavior</h2>
<p>Buttons: primary blue → hover lighter + glow, press darker + 1px down; secondary border → blue; ghost text → blue + 8% tint. Focus ring <code>0 0 0 2px bg, 0 0 0 4px blue</code>. Inputs: sunken bg, blue border + 3px ring on focus; error red + icon. Badges always color + shape. Dialog: blurred scrim, Esc/scrim closes. Toast: glass, bottom-right, ~4s.</p>
